==Description==
'''Electroshocker Jellyfish Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] as a reward for reaching Level 24 on the premium track. It had a cost of {{BeachBalls|780}} or {{Robux|102}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{BeachBalls|8,990}} or {{Robux|1,706}}.  This item also has had two other costs. First one was the cost before its 20% discount, which had a cost of {{Robux|128}} with a total cost of {{Robux|2,145}}. The second was the price prior to the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] individual skip cost fix, where it had a cost of {{Robux|78}}, with a total cost of {{Robux|1,720}}.

==Appearance==
'''Electroshocker Jellyfish Charm''' appearance is based on the {{Color|Surf|Jellyfish}} [[Electroshocker]] skin. The charm has the skin casting a spell. When used, it plays the sound of the {{Color|Surf|Jellyfish}} [[Electroshocker]] attacking enemies.

The color changes based on the player's username color, but appears orange in inventory preview.

